## Ejemplos de Transformaciones Específicas 17.0

### 1. Migración de `name_get`

**Código original (Odoo 16.0):**
```python
@api.multi
def name_get(self):
    result = []
    for record in self:
        name = record.name + " (" + record.ref + ")"
        result.append((record.id, name))
    return result
```

**Código migrado (Odoo 17.0):**
```python
@api.depends('name', 'ref')
def _compute_display_name(self):
    for record in self:
        record.display_name = record.name + " (" + record.ref + ")"
```

### 2. Migración de `attrs` en vistas XML

**Código original (Odoo 16.0):**
```xml
<field name="partner_id" attrs="{'invisible': [('type', '!=', 'contact')], 'required': [('type', '=', 'contact')]}"/>
```

**Código migrado (Odoo 17.0):**
```xml
<field name="partner_id" invisible="type != 'contact'" required="type == 'contact'"/>
```

### 3. Migración de vistas de configuración

**Código original (Odoo 16.0):**
```xml
<div class="app_settings_block" data-string="Module Name" data-key="module_name">
    <h2>Section Title</h2>
    <div class="o_settings_container">
        <div class="o_setting_box">
            <div class="o_setting_left_pane">
                <field name="use_feature"/>
            </div>
            <div class="o_setting_right_pane">
                <label for="use_feature"/>
                <div class="text-muted">
                    Description text
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
```

**Código migrado (Odoo 17.0):**
```xml
<app string="Module Name" name="module_name">
    <block title="Section Title">
        <setting>
            <field name="use_feature"/>
            <label for="use_feature"/>
            <div class="text-muted">
                Description text
            </div>
        </setting>
    </block>
</app>
```

### 4. Migración de campos con atributo `states`

**Código original en modelo Python (Odoo 16.0):**
```python
firstname = fields.Char(
    string="First name",
    readonly=True,
    required=True,
    states={"draft": [("readonly", False)]},
)
```

**Vista XML original (Odoo 16.0):**
```xml
<field name="firstname"/>
```

**Vista XML migrada (Odoo 17.0):**
```xml
<field name="firstname" readonly="state != 'draft'"/>
```
